    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"In this publication, we provide an overview of local detention facilities (such as county jails) in California. We also assess the state's program for setting minimum facility standards and inspecting these facilities. Finally, we recommend steps to help ensure the success of the program going forward, such as establishing a clear mission and goals for the program and requiring a plan to align the program with this mission and goals\"--Document landing page",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
